%% title: Where the admission report numbers come from
%% desc: Children admitted from an online application go to the Admitted card; withdrawals, transfers out, graduations and readmissions recorded on a student's profile go to the other three cards; together they make the events list.
flowchart LR
  A["Admission applicants<br/>Admitted"] --> C1["Admitted"]
  E["Student profile<br/>Record leaving / Readmit"] --> C2["Left<br/>withdrawn · transferred out"]
  E --> C3["Graduated"]
  E --> C4["Readmitted"]
  C1 --> T["Events list<br/>by academic year and class"]
  C2 --> T
  C3 --> T
  C4 --> T
